{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DWARF MINER: The Lost Scroll</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROCK AND STONE, BROTHER!</strong> \u2692\ufe0f\ud83d\udc8e<br>Descend into the depths in <strong>DWARF MINER: The Lost Scroll</strong>, a thrilling 2D mining adventure! Play as a brave dwarf on a mission to recover a legendary ancient scroll hidden far beneath the surface. Dig through layers of rock, uncover hidden treasures, and brave the dangers of the deep!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your tools, manage your resources, and face underground foes like skeletons, goblins, and the fearsome <strong>DarkDwarf boss</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude93 <strong>Mining Meets Adventure</strong> \u2013 Dig, explore, and uncover the secrets hidden below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Enemies &amp; Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Battle hostile creatures and powerful underground bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Upgrade System</strong> \u2013 Improve your gear to dig faster, defend better, and survive longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude99 <strong>Secrets &amp; Relics</strong> \u2013 Discover ancient artifacts, hidden paths, and mysterious lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Controller Support Notice</strong> \u2013 Only supports <strong>DualShock 4 (PS4)</strong> controllers.<br>\u26a0\ufe0f Steam Input must be <strong>disabled</strong>.<br>\u26a0\ufe0f Local co-op requires <strong>two physical PS4 controllers</strong> to activate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Retro Pixel-Art Style</strong> \u2013 Classic 2D visuals with a handcrafted, nostalgic vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Expanding World</strong> \u2013 New quests, areas, enemies, and story content will be added with <strong>weekly updates</strong>! The game will grow over time, with deeper lore and more challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finished the game? You're just getting started.</strong><br>More content is on the way\u2014<strong>new story chapters, quests, and surprises await!</strong><br><strong>Stay tuned, and prepare to return to the mines.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROCK AND STONE!!</strong> \ud83e\udea8\ud83d\udd25</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555490/extras/f47f4bfa2e6346b439db8332a5094e84.avif?t=1757872264\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555490/extras_big/f47f4bfa2e6346b439db8332a5094e84.avif?t=1757872264 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555490/extras/16ea5eaeb07179fdd242428fd4110ea7.avif?t=1757872264\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555490/extras_big/16ea5eaeb07179fdd242428fd4110ea7.avif?t=1757872264 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\"WASTED\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3555490/398d90e2346032e8f262e0bedac04f2b35076a6d.jpg"},{"name":"Collect 100 gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3555490/6028341b239b0d659928d035b5938801ada1ea08.jpg"},{"name":"Destroy 500 Stones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3555490/8103ecaaf4bb516ab023618eaff43b4bc3a03445.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock the BOMB","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3555490/1b2b25d81fb97f6e8df5688871462e246035deb1.jpg"},{"name":"Unlock full POWER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamst